      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w09.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "休みの日。噴水広場のバス乗り場、日向の匂い。行き先は例の観光地——魔王城あと地、日帰り。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "うちの選手も何人か付いてきた。私服、新鮮だ。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "先週の海戦の話題、まだ街に漂ってた。すれ違う人が「あ、四十二点の」と私を指す。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "点数で呼ばれる監督、それが私。次はもっと上の数字で呼ばれたい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "跡地は、思ったより跡地だった。崩れた城壁、焦げた玉座、そして年間三万人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「勇者が最初に転んだ石」に行列。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "みんな、順番に転んでいた。参加型の観光らしい。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "売店の棚は充実していた。「城壁のかけら(本物・無限に出ます)」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「魔王の湯呑み(復刻)」「玉座クッション(座り心地・当時のまま)」も。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "在庫の仕組み、今日も聞かないことにした。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "連れの選手の一人が、棚の前で足を止めた。長い、足止めだった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "自分の世界の、終わった場所を思い出す横顔に見えた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私は声をかけず、隣に立って、同じ棚を見た。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.direction.mimi.shift.007",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w09.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "気を取り直して、名物の串を食べた。「魔王団子(八つ裂き大福の姉妹品)」断面から赤い餡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "この街の菓子業界、物騒な名前縛りでもあるのかも。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰りぎわ、棚の隅で手が止まった。小さな札。「アルデバラン社ライセンス商品」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……勇者の物語の、ライセンス?",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "売店のおばちゃんは、明るく教えてくれた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「終わったお話はね、ぜんぶ会社さんの持ち物なんだって」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「うちは使用料を払って売ってるのよ。ほら、領収書」領収書は、本物だった。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "終わった話は、会社の持ち物。妙な言い方だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "物語って、持ち物になるんだろうか。考えかけたところで団子の二本目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "やめた。考えごとは、団子に勝てない。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰りのバスで、選手たちはよく眠っていた。窓の外を、崩れた城壁がゆっくり流れていく。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "耳だけが、まだ観光気分のまま。観光は、成功ってことでいいと思う。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "寮に着くと、手帳が点いていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w09.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「今週の追記: 来客予定(帳簿関連)」……観光の余韻、短い。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s1.w09.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
